#: usr/lib/live-installer/frontend/gtk_interface.py:368
msgid ""
"Thank you for choosing Hancom Gooroom. Several settings are required to "
"install Hancom Gooroom.\n"
"Installation proceeds after setting up the environment, user information, "
"and partition.\n"
"Do you want to install Hancom Gooroom on this PC?"
msgstr ""
"한컴구름을 선택해 주셔서 감사합니다. 한컴구름을 설치하기 위해서 몇 가지의 설정이 필요합니다.\n"
"환경, 사용자 정보, 파티션 설정한 후에 설치를 진행합니다.\n"
"이 PC에 한컴구름을 설치하시겠습니까?"

#: usr/lib/live-installer/frontend/gtk_interface.py:369
msgid "Install Hancom Gooroom"
msgstr "한컴구름 설치하기"

#: usr/lib/live-installer/frontend/gtk_interface.py:370
msgid ""
"Select the language, time zone, and keyboard environment required for Hancom "
"Gooroom installation."
msgstr ""
"한컴구름 설치를 위해 사용 환경에 필요한 언어, 시간대, 키보드 환경을 선택합니다."

#: usr/lib/live-installer/frontend/gtk_interface.py:371
msgid "Installatiaion First Stage"
msgstr "한컴구름 설치 첫 번째 단계"

#: usr/lib/live-installer/frontend/gtk_interface.py:373
msgid ""
"If you edit the partition, refresh the information, and select the partition "
"to be installed, you can proceed to the next step."
msgstr "파티션을 편집하고 정보를 새로 고침한 후 설치될 파티션을 선택하시면 다음단계로 진행할 수 있습니다."

#: usr/lib/live-installer/frontend/gtk_interface.py:374
msgid "Installation Second Stage"
msgstr "한컴구름 설치 두 번째 단계"

#: usr/lib/live-installer/frontend/gtk_interface.py:376
msgid ""
"The preparation for Hancom Gooroom installation is completed. Please check "
"your settings and install Hancom Gooroom."
msgstr "한컴구름 설치에 필요한 준비가 끝났습니다. 설정하신 내용을 확인 후 한컴구름을 설치하세요."

#: usr/lib/live-installer/frontend/gtk_interface.py:377
msgid "Ready to Install"
msgstr "설치 준비 완료"

#: usr/lib/live-installer/frontend/gtk_interface.py:378
msgid "Maintain the power of the computer while installing Hancom Gooroom."
msgstr "한컴구름을 설치하는 동안 컴퓨터의 전원을 유지하세요. "

#: usr/lib/live-installer/frontend/gtk_interface.py:379
msgid "Installing Hancom Gooroom"
msgstr "한컴구름 설치중..."

#: usr/lib/live-installer/frontend/gtk_interface.py:380
msgid "Hancom Gooroom is installed"
msgstr "한컴구름 설치 완료"

#: usr/lib/live-installer/frontend/gtk_interface.py:381
msgid ""
"The installation has been successfully completed.\n"
"Do you want to restart your computer to use a new Hancom Gooroom?"
msgstr ""
"설치가 성공적으로 완료되었습니다.\n"
"새로운 한컴구름을 사용하기 위해 컴퓨터를 재시작하겠습니까?"

